FAQs:

Q: Is client communication over WhatsApp secure and compliant?
A: Messages are transmitted over WhatsApp's standard encrypted infrastructure; firms handling especially sensitive matters should apply their own document-handling policies alongside it.

Q: Can this integrate with practice management software?
A: Yes, most practice management and CRM platforms support API integration to trigger messages from scheduling and case events.